				<text><![CDATA[SHL = opening balance (requisition) | SH = closing stock on hand (stock cards) | QR = received from NDSO | TI = transfers in | MC = consumption | AMC = average monthly consumption | MOS = months of stock | MSQ = maximum stock quantity | Var. = opening balance minus previous month's closing stock]]></text>
